# A trainer of Johto (HeartGold's trainer battle theme): a stabbing octave count-in and a square lead in A minor that
# climbs by step over pumping eighths. Original composition for this game (plan 20 · J4).
title Battle! Trainer (Johto)
tempo 166
meter 4/4
lowhptempo 1.08
reverb 0.16

track lead square lowhp=sawlead vol=0.86 pan=0.05 rev=0.18
  o5 a8 o4 a8 o5 a8 o4 a8 o5 g+8 o4 g+8 o5 g+8 o4 g+8 | o5 g8 o4 g8 o5 g8 o4 g8 o5 e4 e4 | L o5 a4. b8 o6 c4 o5 b4 | o5 a4 g8 a8 e2 |
  o5 f4. g8 a4 o6 c4 | o5 b4 a8 g8 e2 | o5 a4. b8 o6 c4 d4 | o6 e4 d8 c8 o5 b4 e4 |
  o5 a4 o6 c4 o5 b4 g+4 | o5 a2 e2 |

