  v95 b8 s8 b8 s8 b8 s8 b8 s8 | b8 s8 b8 s8 (b c)4 (b c)4 | L [ b8 r8 s8 b8 r8 b8 s8 r8 | ]7 b8 r8 s8 b8 s16 s16 s16 s16 s8 s8 |

track hats kit vol=0.42 pan=0.15 rev=0.1
